==English==

===Pronunciation===
*(''verb''): ŭplĭftʹ, /ʌpˈlɪft/, /<tt>Vp"lIft</tt>/
*(''adjective, noun''): ŭpʹlĭft, /ˈʌplɪft/, /<tt>"VplIft</tt>/

===Verb===
{{en-verb}}

# To [[raise]] something or someone to a [[higher]] [[physical]], [[social]], [[moral]], [[intellectual]], [[spiritual]] or [[emotional]] [[level]].

